e hogsmeade  branch of ollivanders i've seen a lot of  folks in the comments mistake it for the  diagon alley location which could still  be in the game but we don't have any  confirmation of that at all and seeing  ollivanders here in the background is  definitely not confirmation for it  either considering this is the hogsmeade  location so while i think this is a  possible answer i don't think it's the  likely one so that takes us to the  second possibility which is that we'll  earn this pendant either by assisting an  ollivander or perhaps stealing from one  if we choose a darker path that is  avalanche has confirmed will be given  quests and helps certain npcs cross the  map now this possibility here really  excites me because it opens up a whole  different avenue of other gameplay  possibilities i mean us as the player  doing certain missions or tasks at the  request of ollivander that's a really  exciting possibility and then that begs  the question if we do tasks for  ollivander well what other potential  shopkeepers may we be doing tasks for  and will we earn pendants for those as  well another possibility that sort of  falls under this one as well is that we  simply earned this through the various  cosmetic items that we're going to be  able to earn throughout the game just in  this brief glimpse here they showed that  there are going to be a lot of  customization options for our character  so it only makes sense to have little  accessories like this perhaps  ollivanders is just simply one of those  that we can unlock and we're not  necessarily going to be accepting  missions from him but yeah that one's  definitely not as exciting alright now  let's discuss a third possibility and i  admit this one delves a little bit into  the kind of crackpot theory territory  but hey it's all in good fun right and  this one so i'm wondering what if we are  a descendant of ollivander what if our  last name is ollivander we know that  this is a wizarding family that has 